The primary defense — `AWS-AWSManagedRulesCommonRuleSet`, `AWS-AWSManagedRulesSQLiRuleSet`, and `AWS-AWSManagedRulesKnownBadInputsRuleSet` — is confirmed in **live Block mode** (`OverrideAction: None`) and blocked this attack cleanly. No action is warranted on these; they should be left as-is.

